Inkling-2-Mini Loom card, native NVFP4 + MXFP8 (1bit-MONSTER/Inkling-2-Mini-loom-NVFP4-MXFP8)
Copyright 2026 bong-water-water-bong (1bit-MONSTER). Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

Every file of this card is Apache-2.0:

- Base programs: loom-fun/unsloth-Inkling-2-Mini-loom, release r8 (revision
  4e018e88a3aa9826286c71dfe2f6c905a491659b), Apache License 2.0, by the loom-fun authors
  (Jeremy Fowers, Daniel Holanda), generated with the loom-skills workflow
  (https://github.com/loom-fun/loom-skills). README.loom-fun-r8.md is their original card text.
- Binding changes by 1bit-MONSTER for unsloth's mainline GGUF layout (as in 1bit-MONSTER/Inkling-2-Mini-loom).
- Native-format kernels by 1bit-MONSTER: the NVFP4 and MXFP8 decode, prefill and MoE programs in
  program/llm.loom that read layers 20-23's routed experts as Thinking Machines published them
  (MXFP8). They were generated by 1bit-MONSTER's loom-kernels tooling (a private repository); the
  generated programs in this card are Apache-2.0 like the rest of it.

PROVENANCE.json lists the sha256 of every file and what changed against r8.

Model weights are not part of this card: Inkling-2-Mini by Thinking Machines Lab (Apache-2.0),
GGUF conversion by Unsloth (unsloth/Inkling-2-Mini-GGUF), and the 16 MXFP8 expert tensors
byte-identical to thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini (1bit-MONSTER/Inkling-2-Mini-MXFP8-experts).
Use of the model is subject to Thinking Machines' Model Acceptable Use Policy
(https://thinkingmachines.ai/model-acceptable-use-policy/).
